WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.567
Build and publish your student portfolio

2
00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:07.800
Part A: Build your portfolio

3
00:00:08.014 --> 00:00:12.431
Step 1: Open Portfolio Creator and select Create My Portfolio.

4
00:00:12.431 --> 00:00:15.333
Step 1: The editor opens. Your work saves automatically in this browser.

5
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:25.767
Step 2: Choose a design. You can switch at any time.

6
00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:41.733
Step 3: Click ✎ Edit to add your name, title and About Me.

7
00:00:41.746 --> 00:00:55.567
Step 3: Use + Add to add projects, experience, skills and your own sections.

8
00:00:55.571 --> 00:01:06.633
Step 4: Select Preview to see your site on a laptop and on a phone.

9
00:01:06.648 --> 00:01:10.899
Step 5: Select Export Portfolio. Save the file as index.html.

10
00:01:10.899 --> 00:01:14.400
Step 6: Double-click index.html to check it. This is the file you will publish.

11
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:18.967
File name check: your file must be named exactly index.html

12
00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:22.233
Part B: Introduction to GitHub

13
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:28.633
Step 7: Go to github.com. Sign in, or select Create an account.

14
00:01:28.642 --> 00:01:33.840
Steps 10–11: Select + → New repository. Name it my-portfolio.

15
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.019
Step 11: Choose Public and leave Add README off.

16
00:01:38.019 --> 00:01:42.000
Step 11: Select Create repository.

17
00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:47.767
Step 12: In your new repository, select “uploading an existing file”.

18
00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:51.623
Step 12: Drag in your index.html. Check the name: exactly index.html.

19
00:01:51.623 --> 00:01:58.500
Step 12: Type a short message such as “Add portfolio”, then select Commit changes.

20
00:01:58.513 --> 00:02:05.033
Step 13: Open Settings, then select Pages.

21
00:02:05.048 --> 00:02:14.267
Step 13: Choose Deploy from a branch, main and / (root), then Save.

22
00:02:14.275 --> 00:02:20.533
Step 14: After 1–10 minutes your site is live. Select Visit site.

23
00:02:20.542 --> 00:02:28.367
Step 15: Your portfolio is online. Share the link with your instructor.

24
00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:33.400
Your portfolio is online. Need help? Open the Guide tab in Portfolio Creator.

